    "quote": "If the width $\\wid$ of $\\nn$ is sufficiently large as in \\cref{lem:concentration_inequality} and $\\epsilon=\\bigo(1/\\sqrt{d})$, then the cumulative average regret $R_T^a$ under any UCB-based arm selection method ... is upper-bounded as $R_T^a = \\bigol(\\sqrt{dT}+d\\sqrt{\\sum_{i=1}^{T}\\sigma_i^2}+\\frac{Td^{3}}{ m^{1/6}}\\|\\mathbf{\\util} - \\widetilde{\\mathbf{\\util}}\\|_{\\ntk^{-1}}^{4/3})$ ignoring all other hyperparameters with probability at least $1-\\delta$"
   },
